<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93059" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαίρω</span></b>  (B), aor. 1
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔσηρα</span> (v. infr.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sweep, clean</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαίρειν τε δῶμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					363
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαίρειν στέγας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					29
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Hyps.Fr.</u>
				1 ii 17
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυρσίνας ἱερὰν φόβαν, ᾇ σαίρω
					δάπεδον θεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ion</u>
					121
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				115
			</span></i> (both lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sweep up</i> or <i>away</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶσαν κόνιν σήραντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					409
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰμ . . πορτ᾽ ἀλλάλονς διαφορὰν καὶ
					ἀμειξίαν σᾶραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BCH</u>
					29.204
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Crete</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
